<title>POLAND: POLISH FOOD PRICES FLAT IN AUGUST 11-20.</title>
<headline>POLISH FOOD PRICES FLAT IN AUGUST 11-20.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices were flat in</p>
<p>August 11-20 period after rising 0.2 percent in the previous 10</p>
<p>days and were 0.2 percent higher than in July 11-20 period, the</p>
<p>Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>				   AUG 11-20  AUG 1-10  LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)	0.0	 0.2	 0.2 (-1.0)</p>
<p> Bread				0.2	 0.4	 0.7  (0.9)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	  -3.5	-5.3     -13.9(-23.1)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	 0.7	 1.4	 3.5  (4.0)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.1	 0.1	 0.4  (0.4)</p>
<p> Eggs				 2.7	 6.8	12.1 (12.0)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets figures for the previous 30-day period</p>
<p>ending on August 10.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
